*
* connections:     non-inverting input
*                  |   inverting input
*                  |   |   positive power supply
*                  |   |   |   negative power supply
*                  |   |   |   |   output
*                  |   |   |   |   |
*                  |   |   |   |   |
.SUBCKT LT1491     3   2   7   4   6
X_LT1491 3 2 7 4 6 LT1490
.ENDS LT1491
*
*
